  "meta": {"motion": "static", "death": {"kind": "structure", "ticks": 7}, "doc": "Superweapon (4x4): `kit` = halo_tower | billboard | sunflower | gantry_silo | hive_tower | assembly_hall | long_barrel | three_masts (native sw_* macros with the BLINK charge display), corner floodlight masts. The landmark is fixed-size for the 4x4 plinth."},
